to breathe, gain access to the Ice Storm talent at level %d, gain %d%% resistance to cuts and stuns, gain %d%% cold resistance, and all cold damage heals you for %d%% of the damage done.\n\t\tThe power will increase with your Spellpower.\n\n\t\t#AQUAMARINE#Ice storm:#LAST#\n\t\t%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你吸收周围的寒冰围绕你，将自己转变为纯粹的冰元素——西弗格罗斯，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t转化成元素后，你不需要呼吸并获得等级 %d 的冰雪风暴，获得 %d%% 震慑和流血抵抗，%d%% 寒冷伤害抗性。所有寒冷伤害可对你产生治疗，治疗量基于伤害值的 %d%%。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成\n\t\t#AQUAMARINE#冰雪风暴：#LAST#\n\t\t%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee6162bc912cc701543a147110adb5eda41d07e791debe67e67c7c83615fcaaa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3c896e491d761a16378d3ace521fb677f9d462066480add18720a7a11c01d983","logical_entry_identity":"8de18f24ea0cade85cf33337982538dedeb0a49a3bccdb8c2545fda22d00ac99","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Being stalked.","source_tag":"_t","target":"被追踪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a99bfd30d267af944119018501fc787b85ae2981f4f5a68b1890706791badff2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3c961c20f25b957ae7deaa4245a19ee1715526b993e9317e4b416e92bf9afc5a","logical_entry_identity":"e6a094575555857ba90d47ffe6644a077f0c185b5e6fd03f24b3b5982b020df6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You notice the small things others do not notice, allowing you to \"see\" creatures in a %d radius even outside of light radius.\n\t\tThis is not telepathy, however, and it is still limited to line of sight.\n\t\tAlso, your attention to detail increases stealth detection and invisibility detection by %d, and you gain the ability to detect traps (+%d detect 'power').\n\t\tThe detection abilities improve with Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你注意到他人注意不到的细节，甚至能在阴影区域“看到”怪物，%d 码半径范围。\n\t\t注意此能力不属于心灵感应，仍然受到视野的限制。\n\t\t同时你的细致观察使你侦察潜行和隐身的能力增加 %d，使你发现周围的陷阱的能力增加 %d。\n\t\t陷阱侦查强度受灵巧加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"df7d0734ffa65316d7561b7c799275e4a861583d10f09eeafccd22ba736a8a24","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3c98163fe03